hadiths[22]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1864","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah Jal Jalaluhu ke ninanway naam hain jo koi un ko yaad kar le (yani un naamon ke maani par aqeeda rakh kar amal karay) wo jannat mein jaye ga aur Allah Taala taaq hai aur taaq adad ko dost rakhta hai (us liye pooray sau naam nahi bataye agarchay Allah ke naam beshumaar hain)"
"1865","[AI-translation] ´Farwa bin Naufal Ashja'i raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se poocha ke Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Allah se kiya dua kiya kartay thay unhon ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Ae Allah ! mein un kaamon ki burayi se jo mein ne kiye hain aur un ki burayi se jo mein ne nahi kiye teri panah maangta hun"
"1866","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke ” Ae Allah ! mein tera farmanbardaar ho gaya aur tujh par iman laya aur tujh par bharosa kiya aur teri taraf rujoo kiya aur teri madad se dushmanon se lara Ae Maalik ! mein us baat se teri izzat ki panah maangta hun ke to mujhe bhatka de aur tere siwa koi mabood barhaq nahi hai aur to zinda hai jis ko maut nahi aur jin o Anas martay hain"
"1867","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab safar mein hotay aur subah hoti to farmatay ke sun-nay walay ne Allah ki hamd aur us ki achi aazmaish ko sun liya Ae hamaray Rab ! hamaray saath reh (yani madad ko) aur ham par apna fazl kar aur mein jahannam se teri panah maangta hun"
"1868","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ye dua kiya kartay thay : Ae Allah ! meri khata meri naadaani aur meri ziyadati ko bakhsh de jo mujh se apne haal mein hui aur bakhsh de us cheez ko jis ko to mujh se zyada janta hai Ae Allah ! bakhsh de mere irada ke gunah aur meri hansi ke gunah ko aur meri bhool chook aur qasd ko aur ye sab meri taraf se hai Ae Maalik ! mere aglay pichlay chhupe aur zaahir gunaahon ko aur jin ko to mujh se zyada janta hai bakhsh de to hi muqaddam karnay wala aur to hi muakhkhar karnay wala hai aur to har cheez par qaadir hai"
"1869","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmaya kartay thay ke Ae Allah ! mere deen ko sanwaar de jo ke meri aakhirat ke kaam ka muhafiz aur nigehbaan hai aur meri duniya ko sanwaar de ke jis mein meri rozi aur zindagi hai aur meri aakhirat ko sanwaar de ke jis mein meri wapasi hai aur meri zindagi ko mere liye har bhalayi mein ziyadati aur meri maut ko har shar se meri raahat ka sabab bana de (ye dua har matlab ki jaame hai)"
"1870","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay : Ae Allah ! mein tujh se hidayat parhezgaari (haraam se) paakdaamni aur dil ki daulatmandi maangta hun"
"1871","[AI-translation] ´Zaid bin Arqam raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein tum se wohi kahun ga jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmaya kartay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Ae Allah ! mein aajizi susti buzdili bakheeli burhapay aur qabr ke azaab se panah maangta hun Ae Allah ! mere nafs ko taqwa ataa farma aur us ko paak kar de ke to us ka behtar paak karnay wala hai to us ka aaqa aur maula hai Ae Allah ! mein teri panah maangta hun us ilm se jo faida na de us dil se jo tere saamnay na jhukay us nafs se jo sair na ho aur us dua se jo qabool na ho"
"1872","[AI-translation] ´Malik Ashja'i apne walid raziyallahu anhu se riwayat kartay hain ke` unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aik aadmi aaya aur kehnay laga ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! jab apne Rab se maangon to kiya kahun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke keh ” Ae Allah ! mere gunah bakhsh de aur mujh par rehem kar aur mujhe (gunaahon se) bacha aur mujhe (halal o pakeeza) rizq ataa farma “ aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un kalimaat ko farmatay waqt aik aik ungli band kartay jatay thay to sab band kar lein sirf angootha reh gaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye kalimay duniya aur aakhirat donon ke faiday tere liye ikaththa kar dein ge"
"1873","[AI-translation] ´Abdul Aziz (bin Suhaib) kehtay hain ke` Qatada ne Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se poocha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kaun si dua zyada maanga kartay thay Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aksar ye dua maango thay ke ” Ae Allah hamein duniya aur aakhirat donon ki bhalayi de aur jahannam ke azaab se bacha lena “ aur Anas (raziyallahu anhu) bhi jab dua karna chahtay to yehi dua kartay aur jab doosri koi dua kartay to us mein bhi ye dua mila letay"
"1874","[AI-translation] ´Ali (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh se farmaya ke ye kaha karo Ae Allah ! mujhe hidayat kar aur mujhe seedha kar de aur farmaya ke us dua ke maango waqt hidayat se (muraad) rasta ki hidayat aur raasti (seedha rehnay) se (muraad) teer ki durusti ka dhyaan rakha karo"
"1875","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : teen aadmi ja rahay thay ke unhein shadeed barish ne aa liya to unhon ne pahar ki aik ghaar mein panah li itnay mein pahar par se aik pathar ghaar ke munh par aa gira aur ghaar ka munh band ho gaya unhon ne aik doosray se kaha ke apne apne naik aamaal ka khayal karo jo Allah Taala ke liye kiye hun aur un aamaal ke waseela se dua maango shayad Allah Taala us pathar ko tumharay liye hata de Chunanche un mein se aik ne kaha ke mere maan baap boorhay zaeef thay aur meri biwi aur mere chotay chotay bachay thay mein un ke wastay bheer bakriyan charaaya karta tha phir jab mein shaam ke qareeb chara kar lata tha to un ka doodh dohta tha aur awwal apne maan baap se shuru karta tha yani un ko apne bachon se pehle pilata tha aik din mujhe darakht ne door daalnay (yani chaara bohat door mila) pas mein ghar na aaya yahan tak ke mujhe shaam ho gayi to mein ne apne maan baap ko sota hua paya phir mein ne pehle ki tarah doodh doha aur doodh le kar walidain ke sarhaanay khara hua mujhe bura laga ke mein un ko neend se jagaon aur bura laga ke un se pehle bachon ko pilaon aur bachay bhook ke maaray mere donon peeron ke paas shor kar rahay thay sau usi tarah barabar mera aur un ka haal subah tak raha (yani mein un ke intezar mein doodh liye raat bhar khara raha aur larkay rotay chalatay rahay na mein ne piya na larkon ko pilaya) pas ilaahi ! agar to janta hai ke mein ne ye kaam teri razamandi ke wastay kiya tha to us pathar se aik rasta khol de jis mein se ham aasmaan ko dekhein pas Allah Taala ne us ko thora sa khol diya aur unhon ne us mein se aasmaan ko dekha doosray ne kaha ke ilaahi ! maajra ye hai ke mere chacha ki aik beti thi jis se mein mohabbat karta tha jaisay mard aurat se kartay hain (yani mein us ka kamaal darjay aashiq tha) sau us ki taraf maayil ho kar mein ne us ki zaat ko chaha (yani haraamkaari ka irada kiya) us ne na maana aur kaha ke jab tak sau ashrafiaan na de ga mein raazi na hun gi mein ne koshish ki aur sau ashrafiaan kama kar us ke paas laya jab mein jinsi amal karnay ke liye baitha (yani jima ke irada se) to us ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke banday ! Allah se darr aur mahar ko naajaayiz tareeqa se mat tor (yani baghair nikah ke bakaarat mat zaa'il kar) sau mein us ke upar se uth khara hua ilaahi ! agar to janta hai ke ye kaam mein ne teri razamandi ke liye kiya tha to us ghaar ko thora sa aur khol de Allah Taala ne thora sa aur khol diya (yani wo rasta bara ho gaya) teesray ne kaha ke ilaahi mein ne aik shakhs se aik farq (wo bartan jis mein sola ratl anaaj aata hai) chaawal par mazdoori li jab wo apna kaam kar chuka to us ne kaha ke mera haq de mein ne farq bhar chaawal us ke saamnay rakhay to us ne na liye mein un chaawalon ko boota raha (us mein barkat hui) yahan tak ke mein ne us maal se gaaye bail aur un ke charaanay walay ghulam ikathay kiye phir wo mazdoor mere paas aaya aur kehnay laga ke Allah se darr aur mera haq mat maar mein ne kaha ke ja aur gaaye bail aur un ke charaanay walay sab to le le wo bola ke Allah (Jabbaar) se darr aur mujh se mazaaq mat kar mein ne kaha ke mein mazaaq nahi karta wo gaaye bail aur charaanay walon ko to le le us ne un ko le liya sau agar to janta hai ke ye kaam mein ne teri razamandi ke liye kiya tha to jitna baaqi hai wo bhi khol de pas haq Taala ne ghaar ka baaqi maanda munh bhi khol diya (aur wo log us ghaar se bahar niklay)"
"1876","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sakhti (aur mushkil) ki waqt ye dua padhtay : ” Allah Taala ke siwa koi sacha mabood nahi hai jo bari azmat wala burdbaar hai Allah ke siwa koi sacha mabood nahi hai jo baray arsh ka Maalik hai Allah ke siwa koi sacha mabood nahi hai jo aasmaan zameen aur izzat walay arsh ka Maalik hai"
"1877","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : banday ki dua hamesha qabool hoti hai jab tak wo gunah ya naata tornay ki dua na karay aur jaldi na karay logon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! jaldi ke kiya maani hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke yun kahay ke mein ne dua ki aur dua ki mein nahi samajhta ke wo qabool ho phir naaumeed ho jaye aur dua chhor de (ye Maalik ko nagawar guzarta hai phir wo qabool nahi karta banday ko chahiye ke apne Maalik se hamesha fazl o karam ki umeed rakhay aur agar duniya mein dua qabool na ho gi to aakhirat mein us ka sila milay ga)"
"1878","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke koi tum mein se yun na kahay ke Ae Allah ! agar to chahay to mujhe bakhsh de aur Ae Allah ! agar to chahay to mujh par rehem kar balke usay chahiye ke dua mein israar karay us liye ke Allah Taala jo chahta hai karta hai koi us ko majboor karnay wala nahi hai"
"1879","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke raat mein aik ghari aisi hai ke us waqt jo bhi Musalman Allah Taala se duniya aur aakhirat ki bhalayi maangay Allah Taala us ko wo ataa kar deta hai aur ye (ghari) har raat mein hoti hai"
"1880","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : hamara Rab jo bari barkaton wala aur buland zaat wala hai har raat ki aakhri tihayi mein aasmaan duniya par utarta hai aur farmata hai ke kaun hai jo mujh se dua karay mein us ki dua qabool karun kaun hai jo mujh se maangay mein us ko dun koi hai jo mujh se bakhshish chahay mein usay bakhsh dun"
"1881","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab tum murgh ki aawaz suno to Allah Taala se us ka fazl maango kyunke murgh farishtay ko dekhta hai aur jab tum gadhay ki aawaz suno to shaitaan se Allah ki panah maango ((a'uzu billah Nabi ash-shaitaan ar-rajeem)) padho kyunke wo shaitaan ko dekhta hai"
"1882","[AI-translation] ´Safwan (aur wo bin Abdullah bin Safwan thay aur un ke nikah mein Umm Darda thin) ne kaha ke` mein (mulk) shaam mein aaya to Abud Darda raziyallahu anhu ke makaan par gaya lekin wo nahi milay aur Umm Darda raziyallahu anha milein unhon ne mujh se kaha ke tum us saal Hajj ka irada rakhtay ho mein ne kaha ke haan Umm Darda ne kaha ke to mere liye dua karna us liye ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Musalman ki dua apne bhai ke liye peeth peechay qabool hoti hai us ke sar ke paas aik farishta mu'ayyan hai jab wo apne bhai ki behtari ki dua karta hai to farishta kehta hai aameen aur tumhein bhi yehi milay ga phir mein bazaar ko nikla to Abud Darda raziyallahu anhu se mulaqat hui to unhon ne bhi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se aisa hi riwayat kiya"
"1883","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik Musalman ki iyadat ki jo beemari se choozay ki tarah ho gaya tha (yani bohat zaeef aur naatawan ho gaya tha) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us se istifsaar farmaya ke to kuch dua kiya karta tha ya Allah se kuch sawal kiya karta tha wo bola ke haan ! mein ye kaha karta tha ke Ae Allah ! jo kuch to mujhe aakhirat mein azaab karnay wala hai wo duniya hi mein kar le Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke SubhanAllah Allah ! tujh mein itni taqat kahan hai ke to (duniya mein) Allah ka azaab utha sakay to ne ye kyun nahi kaha ke Ae Allah ! mujhe duniya mein bhi bhalayi de aur aakhirat mein bhi bhalayi de aur mujhe jahannam ke azaab se bacha phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ke liye Allah Azza wa Jal se dua ki to Allah Taala ne us ko acha kar diya"
"1884","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum mein se koi bhi shakhs kisi naazil honay wali museebat ya aafat ki wajah se maut ki aarzu na karay agar aisi hi khwahish ho to yun kahay ke Ae Allah ! ! mujhe us waqt tak zinda rakh jab tak jina mere liye behtar ho aur us waqt maut de dena jab marna mere liye behtar ho"
"1885","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum mein se koi maut ki aarzu na karay aur na maut ke aanay se pehle maut ki dua karay kyunke tum mein se jo koi mar jata hai to us ka amal khatm ho jata hai aur momin ko zyada Umar honay se bhalayi zyada hoti hai (kyunke wo zyada neki karta hai)"
